e="fillColor=#FFEBEE;strokeColor=#DD344C;rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=top;fontStyle=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#DD344C;fontFamily=Helvetica;container=1;collapsible=0;shadow=0;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2445" y="755" width="225" height="118" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="secrets" value="rds!db-… (RDS 관리형 · 7일 교체)&lt;br&gt;WAS 부팅 시 조회 → mvnw 빌드 주입&lt;br&gt;RDS Proxy 도 같은 비밀로 인증(mc-rds-proxy-role)" style="sketch=0;points=[[0,0,0],[0.25,0,0],[0.5,0,0],[0.75,0,0],[1,0,0],[0,1,0],[0.25,1,0],[0.5,1,0],[0.75,1,0],[1,1,0],[0,0.25,0],[0,0.5,0],[0,0.75,0],[1,0.25,0],[1,0.5,0],[1,0.75,0]];outlineConnect=0;fontColor=#232F3E;fillColor=#DD344C;strokeColor=#ffffff;dashed=0;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;align=center;html=1;fontSize=9;fontStyle=0;aspect=fixed;shape=mxgraph.aws4.resourceIcon;resIcon=mxgraph.aws4.secrets_manager;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="grp-secrets"><mxGeometry x="90" y="26" width="44" height="44" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="ops-why" value="&lt;b&gt;왜&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• 로그 5종(앱·ALB·WAF·CloudTrail·SSM) 은 OT 필수 — 앱 로그는 CW Agent, ALB 는 S3 직접, WAF/SSM 은 CW Logs&lt;br&gt;• 알림은 SNS email 백업 + Grafana Alerting(Slack) 이중화 · Cognito·Lambda·Chatbot 은 9/15 제거&lt;br&gt;• KMS 1개 CMK 로 S3·RDS·Secrets·Logs·SNS 통일 (키 정책에 CloudFront OAC·로그 전송 서비스 허용)&lt;br&gt;• EC2 종료 훅 300s: ASG 축소 시 마지막 로그를 S3 로 sync 후 종료" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F3F6FB;strokeColor=#0B5394;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#232F3E;spacing=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2190" y="895" width="480" height="170" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="ops-files" value="&lt;b&gt;파일 → 리소스 (infra/terraform, 1,941줄)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;network.tf · security.tf(SG 6: alb-public/web/alb-internal/was/rds-proxy/rds) · iam.tf · alb.tf · compute.tf(LT·ASG·정책·예약·훅) · rds.tf(RDS·Proxy·Backup) · edge.tf(R53·ACM·WAF·CF) · kms_s3.tf(CMK·버킷 3) · observability